  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>&nbsp;At the axial point of a uniformly charged disc electric field is given by,<br /><br /><math><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#1013;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"178\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image25-118f4e4e-ad3f-43b1-84f3-8d236828c2cc.jpg\" width=\"279\" /><br /><br />By superposition principle, when inner disc is removed , then, electric field due to remaining disc is,<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image26-66eba4b6-ba0e-4225-bad4-71e3fc8f7cf1.jpg\" /><br /><br /><math><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#1013;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#1013;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#1013;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mro